[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607208508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101911#issuecomment-2607208508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101911","id":2607208508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bZtg8","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T13:09:14Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T13:57:31Z","body":"> @lawnjelly Is removing the old NOTIFICATION_TRANSFORM_CHANGED really correct?\r\n\r\nFrom memory, it could well be, as the particle transforms should now be in _true_ global space and therefore have to be recalculated each frame anyway from the `global_transform`.\r\n\r\nThe old particles were in some hacked global space by applying the inverse of the node transform both client and GPU side, for no sensible reason (as far as I can see, it was probably to avoid doing the changes to properly support global space, which we have since done). That hacked global space made interpolation nigh on impossible, hence the reason for introducing true global space capability for canvas items.\r\n\r\nThis may be depending on the changes to support `set_canvas_item_use_identity_transform()`.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607208508/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607295031","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101911#issuecomment-2607295031","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101911","id":2607295031,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6baCo3","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-22T13:47:02Z","updated_at":"2025-01-22T13:47:02Z","body":"Seems to work great, I tested:\r\n\r\n* physics interpolation on, global mode\r\n* physics interpolation on, local mode\r\n* physics interpolation off, global mode\r\n* physics interpolation off, local mode\r\n\r\nI've also tested children of the `CPUParticles` and their transform appears to be correct too.\r\n\r\nIt is a while since I wrote this though (year and a bit) so it's not super fresh in mind, so the more testing it can get (particularly in real projects, which I don't have for 4.x) the better. Probably a good idea to try in all the relevant 2D demo projects.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2607295031/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2612763718","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101911#issuecomment-2612763718","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101911","id":2612763718,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6bu5xG","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:47Z","updated_at":"2025-01-24T15:11:47Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2612763718/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]